<preface xml:id="preface-about-this-version" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
      <title>Note on This PreTeXt Edition</title>

    <p>
      This is a <url href="https://pretextbook.org/" visual="pretextbook.org">PreTeXt</url>
      conversion of <em>Statistics Minus The Math</em>, originally written by
      <url href = "https://nathanfavero.com/">Nathan Favero</url>.
      The original work is available online at
      <url href="https://minusthemath.com/1e/">minusthemath.com/1e/</url>. The original GitHub repository for the book source is at
      <url href="https://github.com/favero-nate/minus-the-math">github.com/favero-nate/minus-the-math</url>.
    </p>

    <p>
      This PreTeXt edition was prepared by
      <url href="https://github.com/PreTeXtBooks/minus-the-math">the PreTeXtBooks project</url>
      to make the content available in the PreTeXt format, enabling accessible and structured
      output in HTML, PDF, and other formats.   All prose, code examples, figures, and mathematical content are intended to be 
  faithful reproductions of the original work, though occasional typographical errors 
  may have been introduced in the conversion process. Report any issues to our
  <url href = "https://github.com/PreTeXtBooks/minus-the-math/issues">GitHub Issues Page.</url>

    </p>

